/// (<c>%n</c>, a <c>%[…]</c> scanset), or a format/argument-type mismatch (a
/// float spec against an <c>int*</c>) — <b>throws</b> <see cref="FormatException"/>
/// rather than silently skipping it. dotcc fails loudly, never silently wrong.
